{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Therefore</b> — על כן is like למ\"ד, a doubled למ\"ד אומלל (weak root). The sense of \"the beasts of the field and the birds of the sky\" is that they will not find anything to hunt, and the witness: \"and even the fish of the sea will be gathered\" — they will die. And Yefet said: for these are worse than the generation of the flood, for the fish of the sea did not die. And this is the way of derash."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:12.772754387Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}